{
  "slug": "delta-skills",
  "name": "Delta Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin for inspecting Delta Lake tables — no Spark, no libraries.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `inspect-table` (Inspect a Delta Lake table — version, schema, file count, row stats, partitioning, and last commit info), `show-history` (Show the commit history of a Delta Lake table — version, timestamp, operation, and row metrics), `show-log` (Read and explain a specific commit from a Delta Lake transaction log), `time-travel` (Reconstruct the state of a Delta Lake table at a specific version), `validate` (Validate the integrity of a Delta Lake table — check for missing files, broken log entries, schema inconsistencies,…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install delta-skills@claude-community` from `chanukyapekala/delta-skills`.",
